
>> shop := (Kamus baru
	taruh: ['magazine'] di: ['books'],
	taruh: ['computer'] di: ['electronics'],
	taruh: ['lipstick'] di: ['cosmetics']
).
Keluaran tulis: (shop memiliki: ['computer']), baris-baru. 
Keluaran tulis: (shop memiliki: ['sausage']), baris-baru. 
Keluaran tulis: (shop memiliki: ['computers']), baris-baru. 
Keluaran tulis: (shop memiliki: ['compute']), baris-baru. 
Keluaran tulis: (shop memiliki: ['2computer']), baris-baru. 
